18	/**
19	 * API base candidates in priority order.
20	 *
21	 * `API_URL` (non-public) is read directly: on the Node server (route handlers /
22	 * server components, where the event fetches run) it is read at request time, so
23	 * the value set in the container (Coolify) wins without a rebuild.
